We'd love to answer your questions mainly around college and studying computer science.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.680
So if you can shoot me a tweet @hellomayuko or use the hashtag

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:36.200
#askMayuko we will hopefully be able to answer your questions in this video.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.860
All right I'll see you next time and have a good day!

